ATIONNAME] reset password,<p style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: 100%;">Dear [GIVENNAMES]<br /><br />A request has been submitted to reset the password to your [APPLICATIONNAME] account.<br /><br />Please click on the below link to confirm and reset your password\, if you did not initiate the resetting of your password\, please ignore this email.<br /><br />[RESETPASSWORDLINK]<br /><br />If you have any queries\, please feel free to contact us.<br /><br />Kind Regards\,<br /><br />[APPLICATIONNAME] Team<br /><br /></p>
